TRAINING DATA

The models were trained on observation photographs from iNaturalist,
filtered to CC0 and CC BY licensed images only. Photographs licensed
CC BY NC were deliberately excluded, since this software is
distributed commercially.

No photographs from that dataset are contained in, or redistributable
from, this repository or the shipped application. Only the resulting
model weights are.

Thanks are owed to the iNaturalist community, whose observations made
these models possible.
